### Repeating Pattern (Sales, Materials, Production, Inventory, Payments, Transport)

All 6 pages follow the **same problematic pattern**:

```
"use client"
→ import hooks, UI components
→ useState × N for form fields
→ useState × M for modal toggles
→ handleCreate() event handler
→ column definitions array
→ return (
    <Header />
    <Tabs/> (optional)
    <DataTable />
    {showModal && <InlineModal> ... </InlineModal>}
  )
```

| Logic | Category | Target Pattern |
|-------|----------|---------------|
| Form `useState` × N | State management | Move into extracted modal component |
| `handleCreate*` | Event handler | Move into extracted modal component |
| Column definitions | Column defs | `features/<domain>/components/columns/<domain>-columns.tsx` |
| Inline modal JSX | UI component | `features/<domain>/components/<ModalName>.tsx` |
| `canWrite` | Permission | `features/auth/hooks/usePermissions.ts` |

